[TBD] Implementation.

Suggested layout, matching the four planes in the README:
  author/    scaffold and lint, wrapping plugin-template
  eval/      held-out splits, trigger rate, blind A/B against the prior version
  govern/    promotion pull requests and the estate scan
  observe/   installed version and adoption per harness

Build the plane you need first. Govern is usually second, not first, because the checks
worth automating only become clear after a few manual reviews.
